   "source": [
    "## 🍷 Speaker Rating API – Docker Summary\n",
    "1. **Build the Docker Image**\n",
    "\n",
    "```bash\n",
    "sudo docker build -t speaker-rating-api .\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "2. **Run the Container**\n",
    "\n",
    "```bash\n",
    "sudo docker run -p 7860:7860 speaker-rating-api\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "* The API is now available at `http://localhost:7860`.\n",
    "\n",
    "---"
   ],
